# wavephysai-heart 🫀

**Chaos-Mediated Synchronization in a Multi-Scale Biomorphic Coupled Oscillator Network**

> Companion code for the manuscript submitted to *Chaos: An Interdisciplinary Journal of Nonlinear Science* (AIP, 2026)
>
> **Author:** Chur Chin — Dong-eui Medical Center, Busan, Republic of Korea
> ✉ tpotaoai@gmail.com

---

## Overview

Three-component nonlinear coupled oscillator model:

| Component | Analogy | Equation |
|---|---|---|
| EM field *E(t)* | Neural / EM signaling | Duffing |
| Heart oscillator *x(t)* | Cardiac rhythm ~1 Hz | Van der Pol |
| Vascular wave *p(t)* | Blood pressure | Linear harmonic |

**Key result:** chaos-onset scaling law *g*_crit(ω₀) ≈ aω₀² + bω₀ + c

Parent repo: [wavephysai](https://github.com/Chur-chin/wavephysai)

